<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS MEDALS TABLE.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-WORLD CHAMPIONSHIPS MEDALS TABLE.</headline>
<dateline>SESTRIERE, Italy 1997-02-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medals table after the</p>
<p>men's giant slalom at the Alpine skiing world championships on</p>
<p>Wednesday:</p>
<p>		    Gold     Silver     Bronze</p>
<p> Italy	     3	   1	     1</p>
<p> Norway	    2	   3	     -</p>
<p> Switzerland     2	   2	     1</p>
<p> Germany	   -	   1	     1</p>
<p> Austria	   -	   -	     3</p>
<p> France	    -	   -	     1</p>
</text>
